  code. NanoKVM and Sipeed are Sipeed's names.

  The client also drives boards running espkvm (github.com/espkvm/espkvm), the ESP32-P4 IP-KVM
  firmware, Copyright 2026 Evgenij Spitsyn and ESP-KVM contributors, Apache-2.0.
  client/agentkvm/espkvm.py speaks its documented wire protocol; it contains none of its code.
